  <NAME>Transcriptome analysis of MUTU I and MUTU III cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>Transcriptome analysis of MUTU I and MUTU III cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>RNAseq was used to identify host and viral transcriptome changes in MUTU I and MUTU III cells. Overall design: Total RNA extracted from MUTU I and MUTU III cells were used for RNAseq analysis.</DESCRIPTION>
